@startuml ssd-us111
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Flight Control Operator" as FCO
participant ":AISafe System" as System

activate FCO

FCO -> System : requestSimulationReport()
activate System
System --> FCO : ask for the simulation report file produced by the simulator
deactivate System

FCO -> System : provideSimulationReport(file)
activate System
System --> FCO : show summary (total flights, statuses, violations, PASS/FAIL) + ask where to store
deactivate System

FCO -> System : confirm(outputPath)
activate System
note right of System
  Parse the simulator's report -> SimulationRun
  (identified by run timestamp; flight count,
  per-flight statuses, safety violations, PASS/FAIL).
  Persist the aggregate and write the operator
  summary report file.
end note
System --> FCO : operator summary report generated and stored at <path>
deactivate System

@enduml